{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:21 2026-09-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:21 2026-09-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:21 2026-09-11 HKT</p><p>深水埗汝州街228號，今（11日）早上11時39分，一名50歲姓溫搭棚男工人與數名工友到上址天台工作，事主有配戴安全帶，並扣在狗臂架上，其間突然連人帶架鬆脫，由7樓天台棚架墮下，倒臥後巷平台，昏迷不醒，救護員接報到場，將他送往明愛醫院，惜經搶救後不治，警方正在場調查事件。</p><img alt=\"劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/725a67531bade3f8a2e3cdc8126864cc/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_47_58_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男工人天台墮下。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c1e43cb042018a765a07361b05ea33e9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_47_58.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"貨車上留有棚架。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a57aac664f13b99960708562a8c02da3/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_38_43_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1d972a85e2b068fb6ff9d39669963c83/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_38_43_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工人由天台棚架墮到平台。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d1fbf35847ac725e7664b291d2c07b4d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_38_43.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fcaaa2a004fc9485338a6c6db1b2fec4/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_38_42_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/61247f229f0c2d90c220ea31efe05c73/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_38_42_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f946ffa46ac0f7492a2c8939a756733d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_38_42.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6368bb0918083615907c79e194bbc22c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_38_41_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dfaa65184a7ebe38fdc8f8e3d040bf3d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_38_41_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c28cbd210d7db6f847a0f73ccb6cf65c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_12_38_40.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n<